{
  "id": 8834820309191,
  "title": "Personalized Wildlife Deer Comforter with Buck",
  "handle": "personalized-wildlife-deer-comforter-with-buck-6532972aba-6532972aba",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in rustic comfort and warmth with the Personalized Buck and Doe Deer Hunting Quilt from Jeminise. This beautiful wildlife-themed bedding piece is designed to bring a cozy, natural aesthetic to your home, making it an ideal choice for both active outdoor adventures and relaxing indoor lounging. Perfectly customizable, it serves as a thoughtful and unique gift for birthdays, holidays, or romantic milestones.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> This custom-made quilt can be personalized with your own text, sayings, or names to create a deeply meaningful keepsake.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Constructed with a soft, breathable fabric outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for consecutive warmth through all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from a durable blend of 70% cotton and 30% polyester to ensure long-lasting softness and breathable comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Exceptionally functional as a bed quilt, picnic mat, throw blanket, or travel accessory for camping and backyards.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simple to maintain with quick-drying, machine washable microfiber fabric that fluffs up beautifully after washing.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Deer Couple-09</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Hunting, Wildlife</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Animal Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
